    <description>When Insertion Order Attached is checked on an Opportunity, update the Account Record Type, Type, and Support Rep accordingly:

If Opp: Agency + Account: Not Open Core or AGP
-Set Top Parent Account Type to Core
-Set Top Parent Account Support Rep to same as Opp Support Rep (Should have been round robined between CSMs in previous flow)
-Set Top Parent Account Record Type to Agency

If Opp: Accelerated + Amount: &gt;10K + Account: Not Open AGP Premier
-Set Top Parent Account Type to AGP Premier
-Set Top Parent Account Support Rep to same as Opp Support Rep (should have been round robined between AGP Premier BCS in previous flow)
-Set Top Parent Account Record Type to Accelerated

If Opp: Accelerated + Amount: &lt;10K + Account: Not Open AGP or Premier
-Set Top Parent Account Type to AGP
-Set Top Parent Account Support Rep to same as Opp Support Rep (should have been round robined between AGP BCS in previous flow)
-Set Top Parent Account Record Type to Accelerated

S3P-1021 - If Core/AGP/Premier has no support rep or Core User is listed as the Support Rep, update the Support Rep and Type based on the opportunity.
S3P-1047 - Fixed OR logic when looking for Core Accounts without Support Rep
S3P-851 - Added assignment of AGP Premier tier when the Accelerated Opp&apos;s Amount is 10K or more.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
